<title>FINLAND: RALLYING-LEADING POSITIONS IN 1,000 LAKES RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-LEADING POSITIONS IN 1,000 LAKES RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>JYVASKLYA, Finland 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions on</p>
<p>Sunday after 23 special stages in the 1,000 Lakes Rally, sixth</p>
<p>round of the world championship:</p>
<p> 1. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer   three hours</p>
<p>eight minutes one second</p>
<p> 2. Juha Kankkunen (Finland) Toyota Celica	12 seconds</p>
<p>behind</p>
<p> 3. Marcus Gronholm (Finland) Toyota Celica	2:09</p>
<p> 4. Jarmo Kytolehto (Finland) Ford Escort	  2:23</p>
<p> 5. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza     2:39</p>
<p> 6. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford Escort		 3:03</p>
</text>
